# Tauri
src-tauri/target
# Generated iOS project (recreate with `npm run ios:init`)
src-tauri/gen/apple
# The Android project is tracked, not generated on demand: its manifest carries a
# hand-added storage permission that `android:init` would overwrite. Build output
# inside it is still ignored.
